    {
      "height": 399,
      "id": "62a09081efc1a537",
      "text": "---\ncssclasses: cc-border-none, cc-card-transparent\n---\n\n#### Description\n\nRemoves the border from a card\n- If grey color, there is no background color (transparent mode)\n- If it has a color, the background color is visible, but no border\n\n###### cssclasses decorations:\n- cc-border-none\n",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 355,
      "x": -260,
      "y": -379
    },
