    {
      "height": 437,
      "id": "d0ec72663ea46377",
      "text": "---\ncssclasses: cc-border-none, cc-card-transparent\n---\n\n#### Description\nCustom border types for cards. This works with the standard canvas border, or when using the border line decorations to control which borders appear.\n\n###### cssclasses decorations:\n - cc-border-dotted\n - cc-border-dashed\n - cc-border-double\n - cc-border-dropshadow\n - cc-border-squared\n",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 355,
      "x": 862,
      "y": -377
    },
    {
      "color": "5",
      "height": 97,
      "id": "6297500554f118d4",
      "text": "---\ncssclasses: cc-border-dashed\n---\n\n**Border Dashed**\n",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 250,
      "x": 1240,
      "y": -252
    },
    {
      "color": "4",
      "height": 71,
      "id": "1f2179e64d3572fc",
      "text": "---\ncssclasses: cc-border-top\n---\n\n**Border top**\n",
