      "id": "0cf61819c1e0ea0b",
      "text": "---\ncssclasses: cc-border-left, cc-border-right, cc-border-dashed\n---\n\n**Border left/right & Dashed**\n",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 266,
      "x": 411,
      "y": 360
    },
    {
      "height": 495,
      "id": "36e8afebb5cf1097",
      "text": "---\ncssclasses: cc-border-none, cc-card-transparent\n---\n\n#### Description\nCustom border lines for cards. Note: if you don't add this decoration, Canvas draws the standard border around a card. However, once you add one decoration (top, bottom, left, right) the default border is toggled off. This allows you to control which border(s) will appear.\n\n###### cssclasses decorations:\n- cc-border-top\n- cc-border-bottom\n- cc-border-left\n- cc-border-right\n",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 355,
      "x": -260,
      "y": 145
    },
    {
      "color": "4",
      "height": 84,
      "id": "f7a410ab4841d2c7",
      "text": "---\ncssclasses: cc-border-top, cc-border-bottom, cc-border-double\n---\n\n**Border top/bottom & Double**",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 212,
      "x": 160,
      "y": 360
    },
    {
      "color": "5",
      "height": 60,
      "id": "be6cc1a2f27f9286",
      "text": "---\ncssclasses: cc-border-rounded, cc-card-center\n---\n\nRounded Borders ",
